    {
      "name": "AI_Dytto_TryStartMagicBubble",
      "start": "0x011D8A",
      "end": "0x011DB6",
      "size_bytes": 44,
      "instruction_count": 10,
      "description": "Consumes 5 SP via 0x011B28 (branching to 0x01219A on Carry set), reserves a Pool 1 slot via 0x00DA62 into +$A4(a6) (branching to 0x01219A on Carry set), copies $FF19A4 to +$16(a6), and transitions Dytto to State $0E (+$2A = 6)."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Dytto_State0E_CastAndLaunchMagicBubble",
      "start": "0x011DB6",
      "end": "0x011ED2",
      "size_bytes": 284,
      "instruction_count": 63,
      "description": "Lowers +$10(a6) by 2 while +$30(a6) < 0x18 (falling back to 0x0123B4 if < 2 or +$30 >= 0x18). At frame +$30 == 0x18, converts reserved slot $FF19E8 + +$A4(a4) (if still Type $002E) into Type $0018 via 0x008D06, sprite #$00141374, priority (parent_18 & $8000) | $07A8, +$3D=8, +$36=0, +$38=$0E, 8x8x16 hitbox, +$A2=$FF, State $10 (+$2A=$1A), +$10 += $0A, launch offset $1800 (+$20000 X if facing Down=2) and velocity ($0400, $03C0) via 0x00E2D4, probes 0x009D00/0x009AD6 -> +$14(a6)=d4, and plays SFX #$800354. On +$37 bit 1 returns parent to State 0 (0x0121AA)."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Dytto_State10_16_MagicBubbleFlightAndImpact",
      "start": "0x011ED2",
      "end": "0x011FA6",
      "size_bytes": 212,
      "instruction_count": 56,
      "description": "State $10 (0x011ED2..0x011F98) calls 0x00E36E, pops on wall contact ((+$40|+$41) bit 6 -> State $16), scans 0x00B922 (d0=$F0, box [-9..9, -9..9, -1..17]) for Flame $004C or Type $0098 (+$9E==1) -> sets +$66(a0)=$FF + SFX #$8004D4 -> State $16, or enemy checks (+$3A bit 1 -> pop, +$38 bit 3 -> fly/cull, else +$9D=($FF0DB6<<3)+80 and +$9C=($FF0DB6<<2)+20 + SFX #$8004D4 -> State $16 +$2A=$24). Otherwise culls via 0x00E5AE (margin $18 -> clear $0(a6)) and integrates +$4E/+$52 into +$72/+$76. State $16 (0x011F98..0x011FA6) clears +$0(a6) when +$37 bit 1 is set."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_Dytto_WaterTornadoLifecycle",
      "start": "0x011FA6",
      "end": "0x0120D4",
      "size_bytes": 302,
      "instruction_count": 74,
      "description": "Command 3 entry (0x011FA6..0x011FF6) clears $FF199E, lowers +$10 by $28 (clamping 32-bit +$10 to 0 on borrow), enters State $08 (+$2A=$0A), plays SFX #$80034E, sets angle +$4E=((5-$FF19FE)&3)<<6, step +$50=4, radial step +$51=20, radius +$52=$20000. State $08 (0x011FF6..0x01202A) orbits via 0x0123E2 until +$37 bit 1 -> State $0A (+$2A=$0C, +$3D=$10, +$02=($FF0DB6<<3)+120). State $0A (0x01202A..0x012086) drains +$8E(a6) by 8, attacks via 0x00BCA4, orbits via 0x0123E2, plays #$700340 when (+$02&7)==0, and enters State $0C (+$2A=$18, +$3D=0, +$10+=$28, +$02=$1E) when SP or timer hits 0. State $0C (0x012086..0x0120D4) attacks via 0x00BCA4, decays +$52 by $5000 (>=0), orbits via 0x0123E2, toggles +$3D ($10/0) with -/+$28 on +$10 every frame, and exits to State 0 (0x0121AA) when +$02 reaches 0."
    }
  ],
